[I] IBus input method engine for Chinese Pinyin/Bopomofo input

[T] ibus-libpinyin is an intelligent Chinese input method engine for IBus built
[T] on top of libpinyin, providing Pinyin and Zhuyin (Bopomofo) input with
[T] fuzzy matching and candidate prediction.

[U] https://github.com/libpinyin/ibus-libpinyin

